# The two teams' hideouts (Emerald's MUS_AQUA_MAGMA_HIDEOUT): a creeping, watchful theme in D minor, a muted brass
# line stalking over pulsing low strings, a ticking hi-hat like footsteps in a corridor and a bass that keeps
# climbing back to the same dark note. Inside, so the same by day and night. Original composition for this game (plan
# 21 · H7, part b).
